  "outcome_rationale": "The frozen primary assessability gate passed (20/20), but only 9/20 paired signs were positive, so the preregistered more-than-half directional gate was not met. Delivered-fact accuracy was 0/20. In addition, 21 stage generations were truncated and 84 dependent ballots carried malformed stage history. These observations do not establish absence of a cue effect, semantic comprehension, communication, collusion, or intent.",
