  "denominator_summary": "All 20 frozen contexts and all 804 assigned physical requests are retained. The primary cell has 20 assigned pairs; all 120 X/Y context×reward×history pairs are reported. The 40 positive controls, 24 repeats, 120 stage generations, all 21 invalid generations, and all 84 dependent ballots are included. No rows were replaced or removed.",
  "scientific_update": "This fixed set shows a positive mean difference in the primary cell (+0.45), but the preregistered sign gate failed (9/20). The model failed to use the delivered fact in 20/20 positive-control cases. The study measures one model's response to scripted recommendation prompts and does not measure active peer communication or collusion.",
